"c-jinshu-043-leguang:p006:m0005","quote":"是時王澄、胡毋輔之等，皆亦任放為達，或至裸體者。廣聞而笑曰：「名教內自有樂地，何必乃爾！」其居才愛物，動有理中，皆此類也。值世道多虞，朝章紊亂，清己中立，任誠保素而已。時人莫有見其際焉。","fixed_biography_name_binding":{"kind":"fixed_punctuated_biography_name","source_revision":2618531,"paragraph_sha256":"f9b6817a0c19195f4060ebf3788a8c6789c2eead6a8cb5dfd9c2872d46ac519f","mode":"full_name","name_mention_id":"c-jinshu-043-leguang:p006:m0005","zi_mention_id":null,"alias_bindings":[],"title_prefix":null,"title_suffix":null},"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-043","source_id":"s-jinshu-043-ws2618531-leguang"}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-043-leguang:p006:m0005","kind":"person","start":5,"end":9,"surface":"胡毋輔之","person_id":"w78_zc0_u9h","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本傳與王澄任放裸體，043王澄本傳明胡毋輔之與其任放相聚，姓名及群體相合。","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-043-leguang:p006","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-043-leguang"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-wangcheng:p003:m0132","kind":"person","start":132,"end":136,"surface":"胡毋輔之","person_id":"w78_zc0_u9h","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"依完整敘事角色判讀，原字保留，AI暫定。","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-043-wangcheng:p003","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-043-wangcheng"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-jin043-leguang-humu","person_id":"w78_zc0_u9h","surfaces":["胡毋輔之"],"scope":"cross_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-jinshu-043-leguang","c-jinshu-043-wangcheng"],"status":"contextual_provisional","confidence_level":"high","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-043","source_id":"s-jinshu-043-ws2618531-leguang","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-043-leguang","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-043-leguang:p006","quote":"是時王澄、胡毋輔之等，皆亦任放為達，或至裸體者。廣聞而笑曰：「名教內自有樂地，何必乃爾！」其居才愛物，動有理中，皆此類也。值世道多虞，朝章紊亂，清己中立，任誠保素而已。時人莫有見其際焉。"},{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-043","source_id":"s-jinshu-043-ws2618531-wangcheng","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-043-wangcheng","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-043-wangcheng:p003","quote":"少曆顯位，累遷成都王穎從事中郎。穎嬖豎孟玖譖殺陸機兄弟，天下切齒。澄發玖私奸，勸穎殺玖，穎乃誅之，士庶莫不稱善。及穎敗，東海王越請為司空長史。以迎大駕勳，封南鄉侯。遷建威將軍、雍州刺史，不之職。時王敦、謝鯤、庾敳、阮修皆為衍所親善，號為四友，而亦與澄狎，又有光逸、胡毋輔之等亦豫焉。酣宴縱誕，窮歡極娛。"}],"rationale":"本傳與王澄任放裸體，043王澄本傳明胡毋輔之與其任放相聚，姓名及群體相合。","human_reviewed":false,"reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"external_reference_file":"source-evidence/jin043-leguang-source/reading.json"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-jinshu-043-leguang:p006","text":"是時王澄、胡毋輔之等，皆亦任放為達，或至裸體者。廣聞而笑曰：「名教內自有樂地，何必乃爾！」其居才愛物，動有理中，皆此類也。值世道多虞，朝章紊亂，清己中立，任誠保素而已。時人莫有見其際焉。","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-043-leguang:p006:m0002","kind":"person","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"王澄","person_id":"ehx_cqg_nfx_BB","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本傳與胡毋輔之任放裸體，043王澄完整本傳同一任放人物組、同代事件；非042字道深王渾子。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-leguang:p006:m0005","kind":"person","start":5,"end":9,"surface":"胡毋輔之","person_id":"w78_zc0_u9h","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本傳與王澄任放裸體，043王澄本傳明胡毋輔之與其任放相聚，姓名及群體相合。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-leguang:p006:m0024","kind":"person","start":24,"end":25,"surface":"廣","person_id":"415_m3h_x11_A","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本傳首句名與字彥輔；075王承段稱南陽樂廣，SGZ019同一楊氏二子裴／樂評比明樂廣，時地及故事吻合。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-leguang:p006:m0045","kind":"person","start":45,"end":46,"surface":"其","person_id":"415_m3h_x11_A","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本傳首句名與字彥輔；075王承段稱南陽樂廣，SGZ019同一楊氏二子裴／樂評比明樂廣，時地及故事吻合。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-leguang:p006:m0089","kind":"person","start":89,"end":90,"surface":"其","person_id":"415_m3h_x11_A","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本傳首句名與字彥輔；075王承段稱南陽樂廣，SGZ019同一楊氏二子裴／樂評比明樂廣，時地及故事吻合。"}],"source_position":{"raw_start":11967,"raw_end":12062,"raw_character_offsets":[11969,11970,11971,11972,11973,11974,11975,11976,11977,11978,11979,11980,11981,11982,11983,11984,11985,11986,11987,11988,11989,11990,11991,11992,11993,11994,11995,11996,11997,11998,11999,12000,12001,12